{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008560/extras/c2b613965146477339c83ee8a30af870.poster.avif?t=1757616040\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008560/extras/c2b613965146477339c83ee8a30af870.webm?t=1757616040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008560/extras/c2b613965146477339c83ee8a30af870.mp4?t=1757616040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Joey The Duck</strong> is a upcoming linear, open level type platformer game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join <strong>Joey</strong> in this demo<strong>\u00a0</strong>in which you can explore 2 full locations and a portion of the third one within one large, diverse level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be fooled by his cuteness - <strong>Joey</strong> is a materialistic, money-driven duck who embarks on a risky journey through the Forbidden Lands in search of a treasure that may not even exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no main menu, no world map, no hub world - Joey keeps moving forward without pause to get his feathers on that so-called mythical treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features minimalist pixel-art style, with the option to switch between light and dark modes, as well as effects like CRT TV simulation and Black and White mode. These effects can even be combined for an extra retro vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins, jump on enemies, interact with the environment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 full locations and a portion of the third one\u00a0</strong>- no main menu, no world map, just go!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Mode and Dark Mode</strong> - switch the style anytime!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional effects</strong> - play with CRT TV or Black and White effects, or even combine them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist pixel art</strong> - cute and colorful!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Joey</strong> - He's greedy, he's cute and he's cool!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008560/extras/91db8f5851e26d6e79ee8a9b64400042.poster.avif?t=1757616040\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008560/extras/91db8f5851e26d6e79ee8a9b64400042.webm?t=1757616040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008560/extras/91db8f5851e26d6e79ee8a9b64400042.mp4?t=1757616040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008560?t=1757616040","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008560?t=1757616040","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008560/8d75064aea720255a859373dfe9d035da31db21f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757616040","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008560/8d75064aea720255a859373dfe9d035da31db21f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757616040","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.ste