ith CRT TV or Black and White effects, or even combine them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist pixel art</strong> - cute and colorful!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Joey</strong> - He's greedy, he's cute and he's cool!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008560/extras/91db8f5851e26d6e79ee8a9b64400042.poster.avif?t=1757616040\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008560/extras/91db8f5851e26d6e79ee8a9b64400042.webm?t=1757616040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008560/extras/91db8f5851e26d6e79ee8a9b64400042.mp4?t=1757616040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Sikor"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3929830","name":"Joey The Duck"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008560/b3c7d6e7b36919a0c5490a28a6a26694c83580df/header.jpg?t=1757616040","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257193782,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193782/movie480.mp4?t=1757436600","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193782/movie_max.mp4?t=1757436600"},"name":"Joey The Duck Demo - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i